<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pros and Cons of Library=
-Level Compilation:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pros:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Consistent optimization across =
all consuming micro-frontends</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Better performance since shared=
 components are pre-optimized</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Centralized maintenance of comp=
ilation logic</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cons:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Bundle size increase</s=
trong> - every micro-frontend gets the compiled version</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Debugging complexity</s=
trong> - harder to debug issues in shared components</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Deployment coupling</st=
rong> - design system updates affect all consumers</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>3. Module Federation Str=
ategy:</strong></p>
