tion, particularly in the context of React Compiler. Can you walk me throug=
h how you'd architect a real-time trading dashboard that needs to handle th=
ousands of price updates per second, and how React Compiler might help or h=
inder that architecture?</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Candidate</strong>: Abso=
lutely! Real-time trading dashboards are some of the <strong>most performan=
ce-critical React applications</strong> you can build, and the intersection=
