<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Benefits of This Approac=
h:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Resilient connections</=
strong> with automatic reconnection and exponential backoff</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Multi-tab coordination<=
/strong> ensuring consistent UI state across browser tabs</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Data validation</strong=
> with automatic consistency checks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Graceful degradation</s=
trong> when real-time connections fail</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Performance monitoring<=
/strong> to catch issues early</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>React Compiler Advantage=
s:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">All the <strong>complex state c=
alculations</strong> are automatically optimized</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Event handlers remain s=
table</strong> across re-renders</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Reduced mental overhead=
</strong> for developers managing connection state</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Consistent performance<=
/strong> regardless of developer optimization knowledge</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">The key insight is that <strong>=
React Compiler allows us to focus on the complex business logic</strong> (c=
onnection resilience, data consistency) while automatically handling the Re=
act optimization patterns that would normally require careful manual implem=
entation.</p>
